  data: {
    LLM: 'All players ante. Each receives four cards dealt two at a time from a 40-card Italian deck. Betting (vying) follows: players may match, raise, or fold; dealer bets first; play is counter-clockwise. A player may knock (Vada) for immediate showdown. Best hand wins the pot. Hand ranks: Chorus (four of a kind) highest, then Fluxus (flush), Supremus, Primiera (one of each suit), Numerus (point total in one suit). Card point values: 7=21, 6=18, Ace=16, 5=15, 4=14, 3=13, 2=12, face=10.',
    Player: 'All players ante. Each receives four cards dealt two at a time from a 40-card Italian deck. Betting (vying) follows: players may match, raise, or fold; dealer bets first; play is counter-clockwise. A player may knock (Vada) for immediate showdown. Best hand wins the pot. Hand ranks: Chorus (four of a kind) highest, then Fluxus (flush), Supremus, Primiera (one of each suit), Numerus (point total in one suit). Card point values: 7=21, 6=18, Ace=16, 5=15, 4=14, 3=13, 2=12, face=10.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest combination or forcing others to fold.',
    gameplay: 'All players ante. Each receives four cards dealt two at a time from a 40-card Italian deck. Betting (vying) follows: players may match, raise, or fold; dealer bets first; play is counter-clockwise. A player may knock (Vada) for immediate showdown. Best hand wins the pot. Hand ranks: Chorus (four of a kind) highest, then Fluxus (flush), Supremus, Primiera (one of each suit), Numerus (point total in one suit). Card point values: 7=21, 6=18, Ace=16, 5=15, 4=14, 3=13, 2=12, face=10.',
